@startuml U30_visit_pathway_activity
!include style.iuml
title U30 — Ward visit and admission v1 (activity, exported from the pathway model)
start
:Admission requested;
note right: started by **AdmissionRequested**
:Reserve a bed\n<size:10>BedService (service)</size>;
note right
  writes bed_id
  retries 3× from 30 s, doubling
  no answer in 30 s counts as a failure
  undo: ReleaseBed
end note
:Prepare ward handover\n<size:10>nurse</size>;
:Transfer to ward\n<size:10>nurse</size>;
note right
  deadline 60 min, escalates to charge_nurse (+15 min)
end note
:Admitted;
note right: announces **PatientAdmitted**
stop
@enduml
